<SiteLayout title="About · OUSPG" description="The Oulu University Secure Programming Group has researched software security at the University of Oulu since summer 1996.">
  <PageIntro>
    <Fragment slot="title">About <strong>OUSPG</strong></Fragment>
    <p>At the Oulu University Secure Programming Group (OUSPG), we have improved the security and safety of software and systems since 1996 by developing tools and methods for vulnerability research and managing complexity.</p>
    <p>Educating the next generation and raising cybersecurity awareness are also close to our hearts. We believe that security and privacy should be built into all information technology that people and society depend on.</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.oulu.fi/en/research-groups/oulu-university-secure-programming-group-ouspg" target="_blank" >University of Oulu group profile ↗</a></p>
  </PageIntro>
</SiteLayout>
